  <item>
    <title>099 对谈-余霁：高平铁佛寺与二十四诸天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e6504e1e94ae6921bd0576</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e6504e1e94ae6921bd0576</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期缘起余霁、苏昊和我在2024年秋天去了山西晋城高平市，探访了“铁佛寺”中30多尊具有鲜活张力的塑像，于是就有了这次对谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们从铁佛寺中的二十四诸天塑像特点，聊到了《金光明经》中的内容；义净大师的南海之行；印度婆罗门文化对中原文化的影响；以及其它一些我们感兴趣的内容。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>高平“铁佛寺”的介绍与感受</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>佛教中的二十四诸天是怎么回事？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>鬼子母的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《金光明经》是一本怎样的佛教经典？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>义净大师是谁，他与“海上丝绸之路”的渊源</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《南海寄归内法传》中有哪些内容？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>唐朝高僧与皇权的关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>印度婆罗门文化对中原文化有哪些影响</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>铁佛寺外景：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FptZorSHZgMBnfv0CXlOmTiYAAIB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>铁佛寺结构图：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUwZJCZEJmfVjT8cyuZ-g3pRcaN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoA2CfFgXkYc5oXg5JWhzv1BVZ7-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内景照片（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbTNqhWogVtv136H5mDt3zPQove.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsxn3YOH3IPsRxmi3vebp4-ZUxIe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0WxMdD9s3ERwJzdiuMqFU4V90y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgiRp-Lb_Z1ZEPQ6Mh6CoK8jCu5D.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncIYzwnAOCk3mIwjC_sJxthCCAS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvrk5hzLCYnezseMiCjsuheWrrnn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6aJRnGlHKNIsnxHlEm8i8OC3lr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlSgU_hYURX_FUIaF4RbVX8_hT-c.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTO3BAnBeix79zPVezopIttKgu6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvS2gyAPTZZr3ot6oe29URMv1XG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLbmlCaLrt32OUd_zzwhtHEhTbP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《金光明经》：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMtitTHJTj8pCGDuHV1P5Xjzgm6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>鬼子母和散脂大将（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWocWSvZC7s-6WgB3BKsBlgi_P0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0QgToNbV5bfM4qzMY9gNWeVtzu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh9cnrbpSEm-VDGy3NTRDgLCiNHf.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgGvhjRbjy0kub0umQbo-q3VHvC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>揭缽图局部（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtW88Y6rtG5IRX5b7SrR8AcGTSp.png"></figure>]]></description>
