  <item>
    <title>098 吴说八道：冷战、Techno舞曲与柏林墙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c953cab977fb2c478df6c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c953cab977fb2c478df6c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这段时间您过得怎样？我们继续“紧张了”的聊天吧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期要讲述的是：柏林，作为世界Techno这种舞曲形式的实际“都城”，它是怎样一步步引入这种音乐艺术的，它的过程与冷战以及柏林墙的倒塌；与魏玛和纳粹；与平权和意识形态，有着哪些关联，以及背后有着怎样的故事？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>汇报一下近一年的生活体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柏林的城铁系统与泪宫</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柏林墙建造的原因</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1948年，苏联为什么封锁西柏林？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柏林空投是怎么回事？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>NO UFO'S：第一首Techno舞曲的诞生！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kraftwerk发电站乐队！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柏林Techno舞曲的圣地：Tresor！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>魏玛时期的俱乐部：Eldorodo</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>纳粹冲锋队长罗姆的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>李西斯基、康定斯基、夏加尔、马列维奇与“颓废艺术”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对魏玛时期包豪斯的感受</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>柏林街景：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2c3xk377_7FQM35LpZnGPiIQjA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSWsu28e-N0DMQS4_TqUg7vRPbk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>1961年柏林轨道示意：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fggej3USWicDOiZ6c3lXpjMgzpyd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>柏林墙范围：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6xgFg7c_vprbOmkGSX3gZrZW2d.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>东方画廊：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8zLWs96bog_73JMRFnfNTOOiSm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>跃向自由照片：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2n9tMP5DQfkyWO6ML-T1UIJbIU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Love Parade：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVE4PbyjjJ4WndLFk3plOR0r2u1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOQ0EwAA8XC8yfLeXOgGx3SQJ5a.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Tresor大门（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPqlxpk3qTV0RZjRsGAhTs_-SEm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内部（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkLYP59vreHIdpq14BOb1rKGuEnw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>包豪斯（德绍）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdLwVs42Q2uWzXm9fEdjT9qaalD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>大师公寓：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYnqB2ATalGsFev6S5zKSPUekAd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAo1ziG8Hd_-sUsCCRX7jWTwMp8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>包豪斯装置设计（1926年左右）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMb8sjDt1gG1dq9VRXyt-0KcILU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>李西斯基作品（网图）：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJESY0CXRnZiJHvRuCJpBN9RmQ9.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
