    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们继续看山西北部的古迹，其中佛光寺和南禅寺都是唐代木构建筑，广济寺为元代、洪福寺为金代。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>忻州古城游览的感受</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>像忻州博物馆这样的地市级博物馆，其实还不错</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>南禅寺的几个小故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>佛光寺的由来</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于佛光寺的一些故事</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>忻州古城</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm90Q761oklvQ8gc4gwqS-t5hybs.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>忻州博物馆：</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlT24a08Bu_lFhpJmJpXxDsXlJT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkWZJ4J_B6OWK1K34qLy8RFyMU_W.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsbXIhanPMPsjpMk7jDp2qjJ7ChL.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQsA1_udHPfzBym1dpSUx-e7JSs.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp766X3GfM-KEs3JLf3Wzm2e87k2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs5vj_r5GSR2JnlPOZTw37lXkcpm.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>定襄洪福寺</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foyjhj_9mtwWevwq_HDyxvwrfuCH.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrwfqzcDfxKzKcEwmkAQh1VReItK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlG60wqzJdpAd3K3bRJUnzGWQ_H.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmF632Fw4lNj8Hp1ZGSulPPyNY2T.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkjgyfo6MRqtqxiDUI0GAAElmS2Y.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVi2RH5iYipUL7vpoJ6A10qmKIO.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>南禅寺</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhzHNJObY76eapEDsKGYHLMfCl6Z.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjrW5BJtqNb_FH28c2PuJfwJ9oDw.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3mElMitl6HmrVUnwBKUshRcBYy.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-CDtFd3UkmX41pO1oj_f4BZOmK.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>南禅寺50年代照片（图片来自公众号“中式营造”）</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPYBAeQdgfJXNUavhfHjq4qCLvq.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp5vivE3GSqKIRjodEe_j9romJjP.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPKs_yMZM7GBWr7k_as8E8qhKN7.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>五台县广济寺</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgAqTlRgHdK0xT-B54-ap9br4LF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSVjCZyfoSNTW0laV8VflU8U4KY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZ7ENoxF5k-RszUAqsVQehF8fQj.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk78ICc2j3slY_-AH6lWRDrjfp2F.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXIuZioj4zuXnpMNBXfxqf36cQS.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>佛光寺山门</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpC2lc-bBekEw1-HGcXWx7xhvUGU.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>佛光寺文殊殿</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmuLMgQS83i2Xd-n2pu30qoDrTnv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FheqkQ9kyRXF1QQhxH3FevMgz8gN.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>佛光寺东大殿</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh4SOxgA1i3DTam1MLqQ-hDwrd0S.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq443gqpZfQ1IxipE-WeAzBOSSER.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5Qsh5gjo03ZTMUIBonN9HxBPc0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://