  <item>
    <title>091 山西古迹系列：岩山寺：一首北宋与徽宗的挽歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67140f520d2f24f2895646c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67140f520d2f24f2895646c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们重点来聊聊：位于五台山北麓的“岩山寺”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>据记载，岩山寺建于金代，早年称为“灵岩寺”，目前现存的金代建筑是位于南侧的文殊殿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其中殿内的壁画，是一个叫做王逵的宫廷画师，在68岁的时候带领他的弟子们创作而成，目的是超度死去的金朝官兵，但画面中呈现了明显的北宋风格，这又是怎么回事呢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就来聊聊，宋徽宗的宫廷画院，以及北宋亡国时的那些悲欢离合的故事。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>岩山寺照片：（源自网络）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2LkCNzJ-s_MKy4Hwxk_q27AeX7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhYfb3Jxq4CusnSxVs54hw6Vo0mq.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnrQaRIfPyw6RtBmi8y6TDEYhaq.webp"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>墙上的壁画 王逵等画（源自网络）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjmFnBELnGZurm2Ib9C5txfd3hB6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsiYgqkM2ciE7JpeDS07zuxkeLMF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FozfRrsB-haOgUA4h2j-sKBBzuVD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpnm0RZP5v67SUWG3_Iks9DiBByO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq0gu9Lg85whrtK9GnTjjyZ3U68p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnVrznXgEqxDCPu9SiaH8oeBos9I.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbdcN2gkz2FpwvS_uieznBeLt9A.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>牡丹诗册 宋徽宗 台北故宫博物院藏：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjpA1N2CsZ2EKuNPeHdpA9qH8y-F.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>五色鹦鹉图 宋徽宗 波士顿美术馆藏：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbGzpHvvciGJf6HjujYo8oGN0NJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo8RAtLcML1as1UtOMvbafHfwXnj.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>听琴图（局部）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtE5CZNGEGNsxAN51I0XpvtDxJzU.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>千里江山图 王希孟 （局部）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTEyvzDO_wHZkwnefPfB6uxx7q5.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>万壑松风图 李唐（局部）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnG3BOaVeFBTiBH5CwQQNL26mN-f.png"></figure>]]></description>
